{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202632fmLnIJhE1795417625.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>明晚攪珠的六合彩金多寶，馬會首次試行「集氣加碼制」，估計頭獎加碼至7,300萬元。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.LOTTERY-1300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sCFMggVrZK1795417665.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>這次金多寶試行「集氣加碼制」，即投注額越多，獎金金額亦相應遞增。馬會會根據今日下午二時，錄得的累積投注額釐定金多寶金額。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.LOTTERY-1300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262UVva5rVwz1795417687.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>截至下午二時，投注額逾6,500萬元，金多寶因此會加碼500萬元，估計頭獎達7,300萬。</p><p></p><p>據了解，馬會會視乎各界反應，再決定會否再推出「加碼制」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T07:52:16.414467+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T06:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T21:34:45.009546+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T07:45:32.412242+00:00","content_hash":"b40fb3a96a1faff169c38e234994de761236ba86662c0d5afea10825f6a7cb9f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T07:52:16.414467+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}